Package: DARERF
Type: Package
Title: Distributionally Adaptive Regression Estimator under Random Forest
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Shengtao", "Dai", email = "shengtao.dai@bc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the random forest version of the distributionally
    adaptive regression estimator (DARE) of Dai (2025)
    <https://ssrn.com/abstract=5683602>. Conditional quantiles and the
    conditional distribution function at a target point are estimated with
    quantile regression forests from 'quantregForest', and the conditional
    mean is estimated by a density-weighted combination of the quantiles, with
    the number of quantiles chosen by cross-validation. This keeps the
    flexibility of random forests while staying efficient when errors are
    heavy-tailed or non-Gaussian.
